msgid "Ab insomni custodita dracone. Stops fake sign-ups without captchas, application firewall and anti-copy pace limit. Open source."
msgstr "Ab insomni custodita dracone. Menghalang pendaftaran palsu tanpa captcha, tembok api aplikasi dan had kadar anti-salin. Sumber terbuka."

msgid "Stops fake sign-ups without captchas: bots get no account, and every suspicious attempt is kept for 90 days as evidence for an abuse report. Nothing is ever sent back to the attacker."
msgstr "Menghalang pendaftaran palsu tanpa captcha: bot tidak mendapat akaun, dan setiap cubaan yang mencurigakan disimpan 90 hari sebagai bukti untuk laporan penyalahgunaan. Tiada apa-apa yang dihantar balik kepada penyerang."

msgid "Protect user sign-ups"
msgstr "Lindungi pendaftaran pengguna"

msgid "Firewall"
msgstr "Tembok api"

msgid "Anti-copy pace limit"
msgstr "Had kadar anti-salin"

msgid "Off"
msgstr "Mati"

msgid "Log only: record what it would stop"
msgstr "Log sahaja: catat apa yang akan dihalang"

msgid "Block"
msgstr "Sekat"

msgid "Pages per minute, per address"
msgstr "Halaman seminit, bagi setiap alamat"

msgid "Pages per minute, per network"
msgstr "Halaman seminit, bagi setiap rangkaian"

msgid "A /24 network for IPv4 or a /64 for IPv6: what a scraper gets when it rotates addresses next to each other."
msgstr "Rangkaian /24 untuk IPv4 atau /64 untuk IPv6: apa yang diperoleh pengikis apabila bertukar-tukar alamat yang bersebelahan."

msgid "Visitor address"
msgstr "Alamat pelawat"

msgid "Connection address (recommended)"
msgstr "Alamat sambungan (disyorkan)"

msgid "Cloudflare (CF-Connecting-IP)"
msgstr "Cloudflare (CF-Connecting-IP)"

msgid "Other proxy (X-Forwarded-For)"
msgstr "Proksi lain (X-Forwarded-For)"

msgid "Rented-server networks"
msgstr "Rangkaian pelayan sewaan"

msgid "The registration could not be completed."
msgstr "Pendaftaran tidak dapat diselesaikan."

msgid "Request blocked"
msgstr "Permintaan disekat"

msgid "Address unblocked."
msgstr "Sekatan alamat dibuka."

msgid "Unblock"
msgstr "Nyahsekat"

msgid "Nothing blocked right now."
msgstr "Tiada apa-apa yang disekat sekarang."

msgid "Last suspicious attempts"
msgstr "Cubaan mencurigakan terkini"

msgid "Kept for 90 days. Never passwords. The CSV of an address holds everything it did, ready to attach to an abuse report to its network provider."
msgstr "Disimpan 90 hari. Tidak pernah kata laluan. CSV sesuatu alamat mengandungi semua yang dilakukannya, sedia untuk dilampirkan pada laporan penyalahgunaan kepada pembekal rangkaiannya."

msgid "Nothing yet."
msgstr "Belum ada apa-apa."

msgid "Address or e-mail"
msgstr "Alamat atau e-mel"

msgid "Reason"
msgstr "Sebab"

msgid "Until (UTC)"
msgstr "Hingga (UTC)"

msgid "Date (UTC)"
msgstr "Tarikh (UTC)"

msgid "Address"
msgstr "Alamat"

msgid "Where"
msgstr "Di mana"

msgid "Verdict"
msgstr "Keputusan"

msgid "Signs"
msgstr "Tanda"

msgid "Data"
msgstr "Data"

msgid "Trusted proxies"
msgstr "Proksi dipercayai"

msgid "Only connections from these addresses may set the visitor address through a header. One address or range per line. Empty: this server and private networks. Cloudflare's own ranges are already known."
msgstr "Hanya sambungan daripada alamat ini boleh menetapkan alamat pelawat melalui pengepala. Satu alamat atau julat setiap baris. Kosong: pelayan ini dan rangkaian peribadi. Julat milik Cloudflare sudah diketahui."

msgid "Countries"
msgstr "Negara"

msgid "Filter"
msgstr "Penapis"

msgid "Refuse the countries listed"
msgstr "Tolak negara yang disenaraikan"

msgid "Only the countries listed"
msgstr "Hanya negara yang disenaraikan"

msgid "Logging in, signing up and forms (recommended)"
msgstr "Log masuk, pendaftaran dan borang (disyorkan)"

msgid "The whole site"
msgstr "Seluruh laman"

msgid "What to do"
msgstr "Apa yang perlu dilakukan"

msgid "Countries (two-letter codes, e.g. ES, FR, DE)"
msgstr "Negara (kod dua huruf, cth. ES, FR, DE)"

msgid "Country list downloaded."
msgstr "Senarai negara dimuat turun."

msgid "Only when the whole site works on HTTPS and will keep working: browsers remember it and refuse plain HTTP until it expires."
msgstr "Hanya jika seluruh laman berfungsi dengan HTTPS dan akan terus begitu: pelayar mengingatinya dan menolak HTTP sehingga tamat tempoh."

msgid "Minimum password length"
msgstr "Panjang minimum kata laluan"

msgid "Refuse passwords found in data breaches"
msgstr "Tolak kata laluan yang ditemui dalam kebocoran data"

msgid "Asks Have I Been Pwned with k-anonymity: only 5 characters of the password’s SHA-1 leave the site, never the password. If the service does not answer in 3 seconds, the password is accepted."
msgstr "Bertanya kepada Have I Been Pwned dengan k-anonimiti: hanya 5 aksara SHA-1 kata laluan keluar dari laman, tidak pernah kata laluan itu. Jika perkhidmatan tidak menjawab dalam 3 saat, kata laluan diterima."

msgid "This password appears in known data breaches, so attackers try it first. Please choose another one."
msgstr "Kata laluan ini muncul dalam kebocoran data yang diketahui, jadi penyerang mencubanya dahulu. Sila pilih yang lain."

msgid "Block an address or range"
msgstr "Sekat alamat atau julat"

msgid "IP or range (e.g. 203.0.113.0/24)"
msgstr "IP atau julat (cth. 203.0.113.0/24)"

msgid "For"
msgstr "Selama"

msgid "7 days"
msgstr "7 hari"

msgid "15 days"
msgstr "15 hari"

msgid "30 days"
msgstr "30 hari"

msgid "90 days"
msgstr "90 hari"

msgid "Forever"
msgstr "Selama-lamanya"

msgid "Nothing was blocked: the value is not valid, belongs to an administrator, or is your own address."
msgstr "Tiada apa disekat: nilai tidak sah, milik pentadbir, atau alamat anda sendiri."

msgid "E-mail"
msgstr "E-mel"

msgid "Message"
msgstr "Mesej"

msgid "Done."
msgstr "Selesai."

msgid "It could not be done for that address."
msgstr "Tidak dapat dilakukan untuk alamat itu."

msgid "No requests."
msgstr "Tiada permintaan."

msgid "Review requests"
msgstr "Permintaan semakan"

msgid "People the firewall stopped can ask from the block page. Let them through for a while if it was a mistake. Draco never writes to them: answer from your own mail if you want."
msgstr "Orang yang dihentikan tembok api boleh meminta dari halaman sekatan. Benarkan mereka lalu untuk seketika jika ia satu kesilapan. Draco tidak pernah menulis kepada mereka: balas dari mel anda sendiri jika mahu."

msgid "Let through 24 hours"
msgstr "Benarkan lalu 24 jam"

msgid "Let through"
msgstr "Benarkan lalu"

msgid "Attacker: blocked"
msgstr "Penyerang: disekat"

msgid "Attacker"
msgstr "Penyerang"

msgid "Ask for a review"
msgstr "Minta semakan"

msgid "Denied"
msgstr "Ditolak"

msgid "Deny"
msgstr "Tolak"

msgid "Your e-mail"
msgstr "E-mel anda"

msgid "What were you doing?"
msgstr "Apa yang sedang anda lakukan?"

msgid "Thank you. The owner of the site will look at it and, if it was a mistake, let you through."
msgstr "Terima kasih. Pemilik laman akan menyemaknya dan, jika ia satu kesilapan, membenarkan anda lalu."

msgid "Request sent"
msgstr "Permintaan dihantar"

msgid "Firewall: last 7 days"
msgstr "Tembok api: 7 hari terakhir"

msgid "Test the firewall"
msgstr "Uji tembok api"

msgid "Works: a database injection was recognised and blocked (403)."
msgstr "Berfungsi: suntikan pangkalan data dikenali dan disekat (403)."

msgid "Sends a harmless attack-shaped request to the site and tells you what happened. It is not logged."
msgstr "Menghantar permintaan tidak berbahaya berbentuk serangan ke laman dan memberitahu apa yang berlaku. Ia tidak dilog."

msgid "The test attack was not recognised. Please report it to Draco Insomnis."
msgstr "Serangan ujian tidak dikenali. Sila laporkan kepada Draco Insomnis."

msgid "The firewall is off: switch it on and save, then test again."
msgstr "Tembok api dimatikan: hidupkan, simpan, kemudian uji lagi."

msgid "The test could not reach the site from the server itself (some hostings do not allow it). The firewall may still work: look at the last attempts."
msgstr "Ujian tidak dapat mencapai laman dari pelayan itu sendiri (sesetengah hos tidak membenarkannya). Tembok api mungkin masih berfungsi: lihat cubaan terkini."

msgid "Never an administrator, nor your own address. Ranges no wider than /16 (IPv4) or /32 (IPv6)."
msgstr "Tidak pernah pentadbir, dan bukan alamat anda sendiri. Julat tidak lebih luas daripada /16 (IPv4) atau /32 (IPv6)."

msgid "Bypass the Draco Insomnis firewall"
msgstr "Pintas tembok api Draco Insomnis"

msgid "Draco Insomnis"
msgstr "Draco Insomnis"

msgid "Leave \"Connection address\" unless the site is behind a proxy: a header can be forged by anyone."
msgstr "Biarkan “Alamat sambungan” kecuali laman berada di belakang proksi: pengepala boleh dipalsukan oleh sesiapa sahaja."

msgid "Works: a database injection was recognised. In \"Log only\" it is written down but not stopped; switch to \"Block\" when you are ready."
msgstr "Berfungsi: suntikan pangkalan data dikenali. Dalam \"Log sahaja\" ia dicatat tetapi tidak dihentikan; tukar kepada \"Sekat\" apabila anda bersedia."

msgid "This request was stopped for security reasons. If you think this is a mistake, tell the owner of the site what you were doing:"
msgstr "Permintaan ini dihentikan atas sebab keselamatan. Jika anda rasa ini satu kesilapan, beritahu pemilik laman apa yang sedang anda lakukan:"

msgid "One range per line (CIDR), added to the ones the module already knows. Being on this list only adds points: on its own it never makes anyone a bot."
msgstr "Satu julat setiap baris (CIDR), ditambah kepada julat yang sudah diketahui modul. Berada dalam senarai ini hanya menambah mata: dengan sendirinya ia tidak pernah menjadikan sesiapa bot."

msgid "The password must have at least @count characters."
msgstr "Kata laluan mesti mempunyai sekurang-kurangnya @count aksara."

msgid "[@site] Someone asks you to review a firewall block"
msgstr "[@site] Seseorang meminta anda menyemak sekatan tembok api"

msgid "A visitor stopped by the firewall asks for a review. Open Draco Insomnis to let them through or not:"
msgstr "Seorang pelawat yang dihalang oleh tembok api meminta semakan. Buka Draco Insomnis untuk membenarkannya lalu atau tidak:"

msgid "Firewall: @count attacks in 10 minutes"
msgstr "Tembok api: @count serangan dalam 10 minit"

msgid "Automatic: @count bot attempts in 24 h"
msgstr "Automatik: @count cubaan bot dalam 24 jam"

msgid "Review: @email"
msgstr "Semakan: @email"

msgid "The test was stopped before it reached Drupal, by the hosting's own firewall. Good: two layers."
msgstr "Ujian dihalang sebelum sampai ke Drupal, oleh tembok api hos itu sendiri. Bagus: dua lapisan."

msgid "Your address as the module sees it: %ip (connection address: %remote). If the site is behind Cloudflare or another proxy and these differ from your real address, choose the matching option in \"Visitor address\"."
msgstr "Alamat anda seperti yang dilihat oleh modul: %ip (alamat sambungan: %remote). Jika laman berada di belakang Cloudflare atau proksi lain dan alamat ini berbeza daripada alamat sebenar anda, pilih pilihan yang sepadan dalam “Alamat pelawat”."

msgid "The header is ignored: this connection (%remote) does not come from Cloudflare or from a trusted proxy. If your proxy is on the internet, add its addresses in \"Trusted proxies\"."
msgstr "Pengepala diabaikan: sambungan ini (%remote) bukan daripada Cloudflare atau proksi dipercayai. Jika proksi anda berada di internet, tambah alamatnya dalam “Proksi dipercayai”."

msgid "Adds an invisible trap and a signed page stamp to the public sign-up form. Bots get no account; three bot attempts in a day block the address for a week."
msgstr "Menambah perangkap tidak kelihatan dan cap halaman bertandatangan pada borang pendaftaran awam. Bot tidak mendapat akaun; tiga cubaan bot dalam sehari menyekat alamat itu selama seminggu."

msgid "Stops requests with the shape of an attack (database injection, reading server files, running code, scripts in links) and scanners such as sqlmap or Nikto. Start with \"Log only\" and move to \"Block\" after a few days. Five attacks in 10 minutes block the address for a week; blocked addresses can still read the site, but not post or log in. Users with the \"Bypass the Draco Insomnis firewall\" permission are never inspected. Emergency exit: $settings['draco_waf_off'] = TRUE; in settings.php."
msgstr "Menghalang permintaan berbentuk serangan (suntikan pangkalan data, membaca fail pelayan, menjalankan kod, skrip dalam pautan) dan pengimbas seperti sqlmap atau Nikto. Mulakan dengan “Log sahaja” dan tukar kepada “Sekat” selepas beberapa hari. Lima serangan dalam 10 minit menyekat alamat selama seminggu; alamat yang disekat masih boleh membaca laman, tetapi tidak boleh menghantar atau log masuk. Pengguna dengan kebenaran “Pintas tembok api Draco Insomnis” tidak pernah diperiksa. Jalan keluar kecemasan: $settings['draco_waf_off'] = TRUE; dalam settings.php."

msgid "More pages per minute than a person reads get \"429 Too many requests\" until the minute ends. Logged-in users, your own addresses and search engines verified by DNS (Google, Bing, Apple, Yandex) are never limited."
msgstr "Sesiapa yang meminta lebih banyak halaman seminit daripada yang dibaca manusia mendapat “429 Too many requests” sehingga minit itu tamat. Pengguna yang log masuk, alamat anda sendiri dan enjin carian yang disahkan melalui DNS (Google, Bing, Apple, Yandex) tidak pernah dihadkan."

msgid "Most of your visitors may come from many countries, and an attacker changes country with a VPN. Filter only logging in, signing up and forms, and start with \"Log only\". Administrators, people you let through and search engines are never filtered."
msgstr "Pelawat anda mungkin datang dari banyak negara, dan penyerang menukar negara dengan VPN. Tapis hanya log masuk, pendaftaran dan borang, dan mulakan dengan \"Log sahaja\". Pentadbir, orang yang anda benarkan lalu dan enjin carian tidak pernah ditapis."

msgid "Log only"
msgstr "Log sahaja"

msgid "Country list: not downloaded yet (it is downloaded when you switch the filter on)."
msgstr "Senarai negara: belum dimuat turun (ia dimuat turun apabila anda menghidupkan penapis)."

msgid "Country list of @date."
msgstr "Senarai negara bertarikh @date."

msgid "IP geolocation by <a href=\"https://db-ip.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">DB-IP</a> (CC BY 4.0). Looked up on your own server: no address is sent anywhere."
msgstr "Geolokasi IP oleh <a href=\"https://db-ip.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">DB-IP</a> (CC BY 4.0). Dicari di pelayan anda sendiri: tiada alamat dihantar ke mana-mana."

msgid "Send security headers on public pages"
msgstr "Hantar pengepala keselamatan pada halaman awam"

msgid "No sniffing of file types, no framing by other sites, less referrer data, no camera, microphone or location for embedded content. Never one the server already sends."
msgstr "Tiada tekaan jenis fail, tiada pembingkaian oleh laman lain, kurang data rujukan, tiada kamera, mikrofon atau lokasi untuk kandungan terbenam. Tidak pernah pengepala yang sudah dihantar pelayan."

msgid "Force HTTPS in browsers for 6 months (HSTS)"
msgstr "Paksa HTTPS dalam pelayar selama 6 bulan (HSTS)"

msgid "From 8 to 64 characters; 0 = no minimum. Applied when an account is created or a password is changed."
msgstr "Dari 8 hingga 64 aksara; 0 = tiada minimum. Digunakan apabila akaun dicipta atau kata laluan ditukar."

msgid "The country list could not be downloaded. The filter does nothing until it is there; try again later."
msgstr "Senarai negara tidak dapat dimuat turun. Penapis tidak melakukan apa-apa sehingga senarai itu ada; cuba lagi kemudian."

msgid "Blocked: @value"
msgstr "Disekat: @value"

msgid "@total attacks seen, @blocked blocked."
msgstr "@total serangan dilihat, @blocked disekat."

msgid "What"
msgstr "Apa"

msgid "Busiest addresses"
msgstr "Alamat paling sibuk"

msgid "Blocked addresses (@count)"
msgstr "Alamat yang disekat (@count)"

msgid "Anti-bot shield for sign-ups, firewall and anti-copy limits."
msgstr "Perisai anti-bot untuk pendaftaran, tembok api dan had anti-salin."

msgid "Administer Draco Insomnis"
msgstr "Urus Draco Insomnis"

msgid "Change the settings, see the evidence and unblock addresses."
msgstr "Menukar tetapan, melihat bukti dan membuka sekatan alamat."

msgid "Requests of these users are never inspected. Give it to editors who write code or SQL in their content."
msgstr "Permintaan pengguna ini tidak pernah diperiksa. Berikannya kepada editor yang menulis kod atau SQL dalam kandungan mereka."

